The unstructured multiphase solver [17] implements numerical
methods on the in-house parallel platform, TermoFluids. This platform
employs C++ for object-oriented design and MPI for parallel communications. Parallel scalability of the unstructured multiphase solver is
reported in [17] for thousands of CPU cores.

