Concerning the wall effect on mass transfer in bubbles, Clift et al.
[8] remarked that CR does not influence the mass transfer if CR *<*
0*.*5. Abe et al. [51] introduced an experimental correlation, Sh =
Sh(Re*,*Sc), for small bubbles and Taylor bubbles in a vertical pipe,
adjusted for 0*.*2 *<* CR *<* 1 and 1100 *<* Re *<* 4700. Furthermore, Hosoda
et al. [105] proposed an empirical correlation for clean bubbles and
Taylor bubbles in pipes. These correlations have been summarized in
